==========================================
AI Tools (Copilot, Cursor, ChatGPT)
==========================================
Environment files (never commit API keys from OpenAI or other services!)
.env
.env.*
*.env

GitHub Copilot logs
*.copilot_log

Specific folders for AI editors (e.g., Cursor IDE)
.cursor/workspace/
.cursor/state/

Note: the .cursorrules or .copilotignore file usually SHOULD be committed,
so they are not listed here to let the AI know your project rules.
Local AI chat history (if you save prompts locally in files)
*.prompt.local
chat-history.md
ai-logs/

